bliss-accesskit-xplat

Forked from AccessKit's `accesskit_xplat` cross-platform adapter crate.

  Upstream:   https://github.com/AccessKit/accesskit
  Copyright:  The AccessKit Authors
  License:    Apache-2.0

Modifications made for Bliss:
  - macOS/Windows: graceful fallback (`Self { inner: None }`) instead of
    `unimplemented!()` when handed a UiKit/WinRT window handle, so
    accessibility is silently disabled on unsupported handle types rather
    than panicking.
  - Android: hardened JNI thread attach (`attach_current_thread()` with a
    fallback to `get_env()`, instead of an unconditional `get_env().unwrap()`).

